{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23503","headline":"九日思杭州旧游寄周判官及诸客 · 白居易","name":"九日思杭州旧游寄周判官及诸客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忆郡南山顶上，昔时同醉是今辰。\n笙歌委曲声延耳，金翠动摇光照身。\n风景不随宫相去，欢娱应逐使君新。\n江山宾客皆如旧，唯是当筵换主人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}